nd asset using  utilization so the raccoon token will  actually be used for applications other  than just crypto ink and then for 2020  the company's planning to add an  entirely new game that will use the same  token system with the hopes of adding  other new partner games we've seen a lot  of really cool games from goodluck 3 the  developers of crypto ink beating all the  way back to 2014 I'm showing some of  their titles right now on the screen  which you should definitely check out  one of which has more than 4 million  downloads  so they have a track record of game  development they're now putting into  place this raccoon token system that's  going to streamline in-game payments for  crypto Inc and their plan is put it all  together eventually create one large  raccoon token system ecosystem a broader  ecosystem that will be used across  multiple games so I'll be paying close  attention to what's going on with the  company and what happens with the  raccoon token it will be very  interesting to follow and we will have  more than likely some very exciting new  updates in the coming months about the  company and the token so look out for  those and make sure to check out crypto  Inc by using the link right underneath  this video
 

